{"id":"9bdf03cc14658aa0","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-iterated-inductive-definition.md","title":"Iterated Inductive Definition","display":"df-iterated-inductive-definition — Iterated Inductive Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-iterated-inductive-definition","aliases":["72-df-iterated-inductive-definition"],"display":"df-iterated-inductive-definition — Iterated Inductive Definition","depends_on":["[[72-df-inductive-definition]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.2; print270; PDF282","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-iterated-inductive-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-iterated-inductive-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-iterated-inductive-definition — Iterated Inductive Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bf103f8baf1db1b8\" href=\"?note=bf103f8baf1db1b8\" title=\"72-df-inductive-definition\">72-df-inductive-definition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.2; print270; PDF282"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,U\">\\(A,U\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\prec\\subseteq A^2\\)</span> 是严格良基关系；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{&lt;a}=\\{b\\in A:b\\prec a\\}\">\\(A_{&lt;a}=\\{b\\in A:b\\prec a\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_a:\\mathcal P(U)^{A_{&lt;a}}\\times\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)\">\\(\\Phi_a:\\mathcal P(U)^{A_{&lt;a}}\\times\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)\\)</span> 是给定的集合函数；对每个历史 H，它在第二参数单调。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ind}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ind}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bf103f8baf1db1b8\" href=\"?note=bf103f8baf1db1b8\" title=\"72-df-inductive-definition\">72-df-inductive-definition</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I:A\\to\\mathcal P(U)\">\\(I:A\\to\\mathcal P(U)\\)</span> 是下式由良基递归引入的函数，历史采用函数限制。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I(a):=\\operatorname{Ind}\\bigl(X\\mapsto\\Phi_a(I\\upharpoonright A_{&lt;a},X)\\bigr)\\quad(a\\in A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I(a):=\\operatorname{Ind}\\bigl(X\\mapsto\\Phi_a(I\\upharpoonright A_{&lt;a},X)\\bigr)\\quad(a\\in A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in A\\ \\left(\\Phi_a(I\\upharpoonright A_{&lt;a},I(a))=I(a)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq U\\ (\\Phi_a(I\\upharpoonright A_{&lt;a},X)\\subseteq X\\to I(a)\\subseteq X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in A\\ \\left(\\Phi_a(I\\upharpoonright A_{&lt;a},I(a))=I(a)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq U\\ (\\Phi_a(I\\upharpoonright A_{&lt;a},X)\\subseteq X\\to I(a)\\subseteq X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第 IV 章 §3.2.2，印刷 p.270 / PDF p.282。每个合法历史确定唯一的最小不动点，且阶段仅依赖严格前驱，故集合上的良基递归给出唯一 I。历史是以阶段为索引的函数，不是会丢失次序的早期集合并。这里是外部集合论构造；形式理论 ID 的公理模式在另一个原子定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-inductive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"bf103f8baf1db1b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-inductive-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-inductive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"bf103f8baf1db1b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Phi_a:\\mathcal P(U)^{A_{<a}}\\times\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)$ 是给定的集合函数；对每个历史 H，它在第二参数单调。$\\operatorname{Ind}$ 见 [[72-df-inductive-definition]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,U","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"A_{<a}=\\{b\\in A:b\\prec a\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_a:\\mathcal P(U)^{A_{<a}}\\times\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ind}","display":false},{"tex":"I:A\\to\\mathcal P(U)","display":false},{"tex":"I(a):=\\operatorname{Ind}\\bigl(X\\mapsto\\Phi_a(I\\upharpoonright A_{<a},X)\\bigr)\\quad(a\\in A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in A\\ \\left(\\Phi_a(I\\upharpoonright A_{<a},I(a))=I(a)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq U\\ (\\Phi_a(I\\upharpoonright A_{<a},X)\\subseteq X\\to I(a)\\subseteq X)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1701,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-iterated-inductive-definition|df-iterated-inductive-definition — Iterated Inductive Definition]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-iterated-inductive-definition|df-iterated-inductive-definition — Iterated Inductive Definition]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-iterated-inductive-definition|72-df-iterated-inductive-definition]]"}],"outgoing":["bf103f8baf1db1b8"]}